            "action_name": {
              "value": "Writhing Arms"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "The baatamidar makes up to four tentacle Strikes, each against a different target. Each attack counts separately for the baatamidar's multiple attack penalty, but the penalty doesn't increase until the baatamidar has made all the attacks. If the baatamidar subsequently uses the Improved Grab action, it can Grab any number of creatures it hit with Writhing Arms."
            },
